Description: Support revalidating local block-backed filesystem branches
 Follow AUFS 6.12 in using FS_REQUIRES_DEV to distinguish local filesystems
 from remote filesystems, and delegate to lower d_revalidate callbacks.
 Keep custom name operations unsupported by aufs-ng.
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: no

